<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy — RemoveBG</title><link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"></head><body class="container py-5"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>RemoveBG does not require accounts or use a SQL database. Images may be transmitted to Pixelcut to perform background removal. Do not upload images unless you have the right to use them and consent where required.</p><p>Temporary local files are removed opportunistically after the configured retention period. On a shared host, administrators should review access permissions and scheduled cleanup.</p><p>Check Pixelcut's current privacy terms for provider-side handling. This page is a starter notice, not legal advice.</p><a href="index.php">Back to RemoveBG</a></body></html>